    'Type literally: apikey' => 'Andika neno kwa neno: apikey',
    'Your SendGrid API key.' => 'Ufunguo wako wa API wa SendGrid.',
    'The Postmark Server API Token.' => 'Server API Token ya Postmark.',
    'The same Server API Token.' => 'Server API Token hiyo hiyo.',
    'Your Mailjet API key.' => 'Ufunguo wako wa API wa Mailjet.',
    'Your Mailjet secret key.' => 'Ufunguo wako wa siri wa Mailjet.',
    'The SMTP user created in Amazon SES.' => 'Mtumiaji wa SMTP aliyeundwa kwenye Amazon SES.',
    'The Amazon SES SMTP password, not your AWS password.' => 'Nenosiri la SMTP la Amazon SES, si nenosiri la AWS.',
    'Sends the mail of this site through a real mailbox with its password, instead of the server\'s mail() function. Without it, many messages are silently rejected: login codes, forms and orders.' => 'Inatuma barua za tovuti hii kupitia sanduku halisi la barua na nenosiri lake, badala ya kitendakazi cha mail() cha seva. Bila hii, jumbe nyingi hukataliwa kimya kimya: misimbo ya kuingia, fomu na maagizo.',
    'The saved password can no longer be read (the site\'s security keys changed). Type it again and repeat the test.' => 'Nenosiri lililohifadhiwa haliwezi kusomeka tena (funguo za usalama za tovuti zimebadilika). Liandike tena na urudie jaribio.',
    '%s is sending the mail of this site. Turn it off before testing or switching on this module.' => '%s inatuma barua za tovuti hii. Izime kabla ya kujaribu au kuwasha moduli hii.',
    'The domain has DMARC "%s" and this site sends with PHP mail(): messages, including login codes, may never arrive even though the site says "sent".' => 'Kikoa kina DMARC "%s" na tovuti hii inatuma kwa PHP mail(): jumbe, zikiwemo misimbo ya kuingia, huenda zisifike kamwe ingawa tovuti inasema "imetumwa".',
    'The sender %1$s is not from the domain of this site. Use an @%2$s address or messages may be rejected.' => 'Mtumaji %1$s hatoki kwenye kikoa cha tovuti hii. Tumia anwani ya @%2$s la sivyo jumbe zinaweza kukataliwa.',
    'Sending through SMTP as %s' => 'Inatuma kupitia SMTP kama %s',
    'Sending through %s' => 'Inatuma kupitia %s',
    'Sending with PHP mail()' => 'Inatuma kwa PHP mail()',
    '1. Connection' => '1. Muunganisho',
    'Save connection' => 'Hifadhi muunganisho',
    '2. Test' => '2. Jaribio',
    'Save the connection to send tests.' => 'Hifadhi muunganisho ili kutuma majaribio.',
    'Send a test and check that it arrived, also in spam. "Accepted" only means the server took it.' => 'Tuma jaribio na uangalie kama limefika, pia kwenye barua taka. "Imekubaliwa" inamaanisha tu kwamba seva imelipokea.',
    'Send a test to' => 'Tuma jaribio kwa',
    'Send test' => 'Tuma jaribio',
    '3. Switch on' => '3. Washa',
    'Until this step, the site keeps sending as before.' => 'Hadi hatua hii, tovuti inaendelea kutuma kama zamani.',
    'This forgets the connection above (server, user, password and sender) and goes back to PHP mail(). Modules that send login codes are switched off, because the codes might not arrive.' => 'Hii inasahau muunganisho ulio juu (seva, mtumiaji, nenosiri na mtumaji) na kurudi kwenye PHP mail(). Moduli zinazotuma misimbo ya kuingia zinazimwa, kwa sababu misimbo huenda isifike.',
    'Go back to PHP mail() and forget the connection' => 'Rudi kwenye PHP mail() na usahau muunganisho',
    'Switch on SMTP for this site' => 'Washa SMTP kwa tovuti hii',
    'It can be switched on once a test succeeds.' => 'Inaweza kuwashwa jaribio likifaulu.',
    'Usually the full address of the mailbox. Not your WordPress username.' => 'Kwa kawaida anwani kamili ya sanduku la barua. Si jina lako la mtumiaji la WordPress.',
    'The password of that mailbox, not the one for WordPress or your hosting.' => 'Nenosiri la sanduku hilo la barua, si la WordPress au la mwenyeji wa tovuti.',
    'Mail on your own domain (recommended)' => 'Barua pepe kwenye kikoa chako mwenyewe (inapendekezwa)',
    'Sending services' => 'Huduma za kutuma',
    'Personal mail (not recommended)' => 'Barua pepe binafsi (haipendekezwi)',
    'Choose your provider…' => 'Chagua mtoa huduma wako…',
    'Where is your mailbox?' => 'Sanduku lako la barua liko wapi?',
    'Preferably a mailbox on the domain of this site, @%1$s. This fills in server, encryption and port. If your provider is not listed, the server is usually mail.%2$s: type it by hand and confirm it with them.' => 'Bora sanduku la barua kwenye kikoa cha tovuti hii, @%1$s. Hii inajaza seva, usimbaji fiche na mlango. Mtoa huduma wako asipokuwa kwenye orodha, seva kwa kawaida ni mail.%2$s: iandike kwa mkono na uthibitishe nao.',
    'Outgoing server (SMTP)' => 'Seva ya kutuma (SMTP)',
    'The address of the server that sends the mail. Your provider gives it to you.' => 'Anwani ya seva inayotuma barua. Mtoa huduma wako anakupa.',
    'Encryption and port' => 'Usimbaji fiche na mlango',
    'Port' => 'Mlango',
    'Use what your provider says. If it does not connect, try the other option.' => 'Tumia anachosema mtoa huduma wako. Isipounganika, jaribu chaguo lingine.',
    'Username' => 'Jina la mtumiaji',
    'Password' => 'Nenosiri',
    'Saved. Leave empty to keep it' => 'Limehifadhiwa. Acha wazi ili kulibakiza',
    'It is stored encrypted.' => 'Linahifadhiwa likiwa limesimbwa fiche.',
    'Sender address (optional)' => 'Anwani ya mtumaji (si lazima)',
    'The address people see. Empty uses the username above, which is normal. If you fill it in, it must be a mailbox or authorised alias on the domain of this site.' => 'Anwani ambayo watu wanaiona. Ikiwa wazi, jina la mtumiaji lililo juu linatumika, jambo la kawaida. Ukiijaza, lazima iwe sanduku la barua au jina mbadala lililoruhusiwa kwenye kikoa cha tovuti hii.',
    'Sender name (optional)' => 'Jina la mtumaji (si lazima)',
    'The name people see. Empty keeps whatever each plugin sets, usually "WordPress".' => 'Jina ambalo watu wanaliona. Likiwa wazi, linabaki lile kila programu-jalizi inaloweka, kwa kawaida "WordPress".',
    'Addresses for security alerts' => 'Anwani za tahadhari za usalama',
    'One per line. Besides the administrator, they receive the WordPress link to get in and fix the site if a plugin or theme breaks it (it gives access to the dashboard: trusted mailboxes only), and password-change alerts. Put at least one that is not @%s: if this domain fails, alerts still arrive.' => 'Moja kwa kila mstari. Mbali na msimamizi, wanapokea kiungo cha WordPress cha kuingia na kurekebisha tovuti ikiharibiwa na programu-jalizi au mandhari (kinatoa ufikiaji wa dashibodi: masanduku yanayoaminika pekee), na tahadhari za kubadilisha nenosiri. Weka angalau moja ambayo si @%s: kikoa hiki kikishindwa, tahadhari bado zitafika.',
    'The username is not an e-mail address: type an address on this domain in "Sender address".' => 'Jina la mtumiaji si anwani ya barua pepe: andika anwani kwenye kikoa hiki katika "Anwani ya mtumaji".',
    'This sender is not from the domain of this site. Use an @%s address or messages may be rejected.' => 'Mtumaji huyu hatoki kwenye kikoa cha tovuti hii. Tumia anwani ya @%s la sivyo jumbe zinaweza kukataliwa.',
    'Connection saved. Now send a test.' => 'Muunganisho umehifadhiwa. Sasa tuma jaribio.',
    'SMTP switched on. The mail of this site now leaves through your mailbox.' => 'SMTP imewashwa. Barua za tovuti hii sasa zinatoka kupitia sanduku lako la barua.',
    'Connection forgotten. The site sends with PHP mail() again. The alert addresses were kept.' => 'Muunganisho umesahauliwa. Tovuti inatuma tena kwa PHP mail(). Anwani za tahadhari zimebakizwa.',
    'Test sent to %s. The server accepted it: check that it arrived, also in spam.' => 'Jaribio limetumwa kwa %s. Seva imelikubali: angalia kama limefika, pia kwenye barua taka.',
    'Missing data. Check server, username, password, sender and recipient.' => 'Data haijakamilika. Angalia seva, jina la mtumiaji, nenosiri, mtumaji na mpokeaji.',
    'Not saved: the password could not be encrypted (OpenSSL is missing on the server).' => 'Haijahifadhiwa: nenosiri halikuweza kusimbwa fiche (OpenSSL haipo kwenye seva).',
    'A successful test with this connection is needed first.' => 'Jaribio lililofaulu kwa muunganisho huu linahitajika kwanza.',
    'Another plugin is sending the mail of this site. Turn it off first.' => 'Programu-jalizi nyingine inatuma barua za tovuti hii. Izime kwanza.',
