    'Another plugin' => 'Programu-jalizi nyingine',
    'Recent messages' => 'Jumbe za hivi karibuni',
    '"Accepted" means the server took it, not that it reached the inbox. With PHP mail(), not even that. Message bodies are never stored.' => '"Imekubaliwa" inamaanisha seva imeupokea, si kwamba umefika kwenye kikasha. Kwa PHP mail(), hata hilo hakuna. Maandishi ya jumbe hayahifadhiwi kamwe.',
