    'Automatic message from %s.' => 'Ujumbe wa kiotomatiki kutoka %s.',
    'Protected by Draco Insomnis · OPNV Systems.' => 'Inalindwa na Draco Insomnis · OPNV Systems.',
    'The saved password can no longer be read. Type it again.' => 'Nenosiri lililohifadhiwa haliwezi kusomeka tena. Liandike tena.',
    '%s is sending the mail of this site. Turn it off first.' => '%s inatuma barua za tovuti hii. Izime kwanza.',
    'Mail test · %s' => 'Jaribio la barua · %s',
    'If you can read this, the mail of your site leaves correctly through this connection.' => 'Ukiweza kusoma hili, barua za tovuti yako zinatoka vizuri kupitia muunganisho huu.',
    'Anti-bot shield' => 'Ngao dhidi ya roboti',
    'Stops programs that create fake accounts before the account exists. The bot is told "registration complete" after a short wait, and the attempt is kept as evidence. Nothing is sent back to the attacker.' => 'Inasimamisha programu zinazounda akaunti bandia kabla akaunti haijakuwepo. Roboti huambiwa "usajili umekamilika" baada ya kusubiri kidogo, na jaribio huhifadhiwa kama ushahidi. Hakuna kinachorudishwa kwa mshambulizi.',
    'Protect sign-ups (WordPress, WooCommerce and RealHomes)' => 'Linda usajili (WordPress, WooCommerce na RealHomes)',
    'Visitor address' => 'Anwani ya mgeni',
    'Connection address (safest; use this unless the site is behind a proxy)' => 'Anwani ya muunganisho (salama zaidi; tumia hii isipokuwa tovuti iko nyuma ya proksi)',
    'Cloudflare header (only if every visit goes through Cloudflare)' => 'Kichwa cha Cloudflare (tu ikiwa kila ziara inapitia Cloudflare)',
    'X-Forwarded-For (only behind your own proxy or CDN)' => 'X-Forwarded-For (tu nyuma ya proksi au CDN yako mwenyewe)',
    'Your address as the plugin sees it:' => 'Anwani yako kama programu-jalizi inavyoiona:',
    'Rented-server networks to watch, besides the ones already known (one per line, e.g. 198.51.100.0/24)' => 'Mitandao ya seva za kukodi ya kufuatilia, mbali na inayojulikana (moja kwa kila mstari, mf. 198.51.100.0/24)',
    'Block a sender' => 'Zuia mtumaji',
    'For' => 'Kwa muda wa',
    'Reason' => 'Sababu',
    'Active blocks' => 'Vizuizi vinavyotumika',
    'Value' => 'Thamani',
    'Until (UTC)' => 'Hadi (UTC)',
    'Unblock' => 'Ondoa kizuizi',
    'None.' => 'Hakuna.',
    'already blocked' => 'tayari imezuiwa',
    'asked for an admin role' => 'iliomba nafasi ya msimamizi',
    'role that does not exist' => 'nafasi isiyokuwepo',
    'filled the trap field' => 'ilijaza sehemu ya mtego',
    'forged page stamp' => 'muhuri wa ukurasa wa kughushi',
    'never loaded the page' => 'haikuwahi kupakia ukurasa',
    'too fast' => 'haraka mno',
    'random username' => 'jina la mtumiaji la nasibu',
    'rented server' => 'seva ya kukodi',
    'repeat offender' => 'mkosaji wa kurudia',
    'a script, not a browser' => 'hati, si kivinjari',
    'Recent suspicious attempts' => 'Majaribio ya kutiliwa shaka ya hivi karibuni',
    'Kept for 90 days. Three bot attempts in a day block the address for a week. "Evidence" downloads everything from that address as a CSV file to attach to an abuse report to the network provider.' => 'Huhifadhiwa siku 90. Majaribio matatu ya roboti kwa siku huzuia anwani kwa wiki moja. "Ushahidi" hupakua kila kitu kutoka kwa anwani hiyo kama faili ya CSV ya kuambatisha kwenye ripoti ya matumizi mabaya kwa mtoa huduma wa mtandao.',
    'Points' => 'Alama',
    'Verdict' => 'Uamuzi',
    'Why' => 'Kwa nini',
    'User / e-mail' => 'Mtumiaji / barua pepe',
    'Bot' => 'Roboti',
    'Doubtful' => 'Ya shaka',
    'No suspicious attempts yet.' => 'Hakuna majaribio ya kutiliwa shaka bado.',
    'The shield is off.' => 'Ngao imezimwa.',
    'Invalid address.' => 'Anwani si halali.',
    'Automatic: %d bot attempts in 24 h' => 'Kiotomatiki: majaribio %d ya roboti ndani ya saa 24',
    'Ab insomni custodita dracone. Open-source security by Notorius Vision (OPNV Systems · OPNV SOLΞ): anti-bot shield without captchas, e-mail confirmation of forms and sign-ups, two-step login, firewall and site mail (SMTP).' => 'Ab insomni custodita dracone. Usalama wa chanzo huria na Notorius Vision (OPNV Systems · OPNV SOLΞ): ngao dhidi ya roboti bila captcha, uthibitisho wa fomu na usajili kwa barua pepe, kuingia kwa hatua mbili, ngome ya mtandao na barua pepe ya tovuti (SMTP).',
    'Ab insomni custodita dracone. Open-source security by Notorius Vision (OPNV Systems · OPNV SOLΞ): anti-bot shield without captchas, e-mail confirmation of forms and sign-ups, two-step login, firewall, anti-copy and site mail (SMTP).' => 'Ab insomni custodita dracone. Usalama wa chanzo huria na Notorius Vision (OPNV Systems · OPNV SOLΞ): ngao dhidi ya roboti bila captcha, uthibitisho wa fomu na usajili kwa barua pepe, kuingia kwa hatua mbili, ngome ya mtandao, kuzuia kunakili na barua pepe ya tovuti (SMTP).',
    'Anti-copy' => 'Kuzuia kunakili',
    'Makes it harder to copy the whole site in one go, without getting in the way of visitors or search engines. People logged in and the addresses an administrator used are never limited. Start with "Log only" for a few days and look at the list below.' => 'Inafanya iwe vigumu kunakili tovuti nzima kwa mara moja, bila kuwazuia wageni au injini za utafutaji. Walioingia na anwani alizotumia msimamizi hawapunguziwi kamwe. Anza na "Rekodi tu" kwa siku chache na uangalie orodha hapa chini.',
    'Off' => 'Imezimwa',
    'Log only: write down what it would stop, without stopping anything' => 'Rekodi tu: inaandika ambacho ingezuia, bila kuzuia chochote',
    'Content API' => 'API ya maudhui',
    'WordPress publishes every post, page and image as JSON at /wp-json/wp/v2/, which lets anyone download the whole site in a few requests. This closes those reads to anonymous visitors; the pages themselves stay public.' => 'WordPress huchapisha kila chapisho, ukurasa na picha kama JSON kwenye /wp-json/wp/v2/, jambo linalomwezesha yeyote kupakua tovuti nzima kwa maombi machache. Hili linafunga usomaji huo kwa wageni wasiojulikana; kurasa zenyewe zinabaki za umma.',
    'Routes that stay open' => 'Njia zinazobaki wazi',
    'One per line, for example /wp/v2/posts if your theme loads more posts with JavaScript. The log below shows which routes visitors really use. Other APIs (forms, shop, embeds) are never affected.' => 'Moja kwa kila mstari, kwa mfano /wp/v2/posts ikiwa mandhari yako hupakia machapisho zaidi kwa JavaScript. Kumbukumbu hapa chini inaonyesha njia ambazo wageni hutumia kweli. API nyingine (fomu, duka, viambatisho) haziathiriwi kamwe.',
    'Pace' => 'Kasi',
    'More pages per minute than a person reads get "429 Too many requests" for the rest of that minute. Google, Bing, Apple and Yandex are recognised by their reverse DNS and never limited; a program that only pretends to be them is.' => 'Kurasa nyingi kwa dakika kuliko mtu anavyosoma hupata "429 Too many requests" kwa dakika iliyobaki. Google, Bing, Apple na Yandex hutambuliwa kwa DNS ya kinyume na hawapunguziwi kamwe; programu inayojifanya tu kuwa wao hupunguziwa.',
    'Pages per minute from one address' => 'Kurasa kwa dakika kutoka anwani moja',
    'Pages per minute from one network (the 256 addresses around it)' => 'Kurasa kwa dakika kutoka mtandao mmoja (anwani 256 zinazouzunguka)',
    'Only requests that reach WordPress count: images, styles and pages served by a cache do not. Each counted request writes two small counters, so on a very busy site without an object cache keep this off or in log mode.' => 'Ni maombi yanayofika WordPress pekee yanayohesabiwa: picha, mitindo na kurasa zinazotolewa na akiba hazihesabiwi. Kila ombi linalohesabiwa huandika vihesabu viwili vidogo, kwa hivyo kwenye tovuti yenye shughuli nyingi bila akiba ya vitu, iache imezimwa au katika hali ya kurekodi.',
    'content API' => 'API ya maudhui',
    'too fast, one address' => 'haraka mno, anwani moja',
