    'On' => 'Imewashwa',
    'Log only' => 'Rekodi tu',
    'Everything Draco Insomnis protects on this site, at a glance. Each module can be switched on and off on its own screen.' => 'Kila kitu ambacho Draco Insomnis inalinda kwenye tovuti hii, kwa mtazamo mmoja. Kila moduli inaweza kuwashwa na kuzimwa kwenye skrini yake.',
    'bots stopped in sign-ups' => 'roboti zilizozuiwa kwenye usajili',
