    'attacks seen by the firewall' => 'mashambulizi yaliyoonwa na ngome',
    'copy attempts recorded' => 'majaribio ya kunakili yaliyorekodiwa',
    'Last 7 days.' => 'Siku 7 zilizopita.',
    '%d blocked addresses or e-mails right now' => 'Anwani au barua pepe %d zimezuiwa sasa hivi',
    'Fake sign-ups are answered "done" and kept as evidence.' => 'Usajili bandia hujibiwa "imekamilika" na huhifadhiwa kama ushahidi.',
    '%d waiting for their sender to confirm' => '%d vinasubiri mtumaji athibitishe',
    'On without SMTP: confirmations may not arrive.' => 'Imewashwa bila SMTP: uthibitisho huenda usifike.',
    'Messages, comments and new accounts wait for an e-mail confirmation.' => 'Jumbe, maoni na akaunti mpya zinasubiri uthibitisho wa barua pepe.',
    'Only the password is asked for.' => 'Nenosiri pekee linaombwa.',
    'Trusted devices: 7 days without a code.' => 'Vifaa vinavyoaminika: siku 7 bila msimbo.',
    'A code at every login.' => 'Msimbo kila unapoingia.',
    'Stopping attacks.' => 'Inazuia mashambulizi.',
