    'Missing' => 'Haipo',
    'SMTP' => 'SMTP',
    'Choose your provider and the server, encryption and port fill themselves in.' => 'Chagua mtoa huduma wako na seva, usimbaji fiche na mlango vitajijaza.',
    'Saved' => 'Imehifadhiwa',
    'Passed' => 'Imefaulu',
    'WordPress, WooCommerce and RealHomes sign-up forms.' => 'Fomu za usajili za WordPress, WooCommerce na RealHomes.',
    'A hidden trap field and a signed page stamp: people never solve puzzles.' => 'Sehemu ya mtego iliyofichwa na muhuri wa ukurasa uliotiwa saini: watu hawatatui mafumbo kamwe.',
    'Never an administrator, nor your own address.' => 'Kamwe si msimamizi, wala anwani yako mwenyewe.',
    'Active: %d' => 'Vinavyotumika: %d',
    'The header is ignored: this connection (%s) does not come from Cloudflare or from a trusted proxy. If your proxy is on the internet, add its addresses below.' => 'Kichwa kimepuuzwa: muunganisho huu (%s) hautoki Cloudflare wala kwa proksi inayoaminika. Ikiwa proksi yako iko kwenye intaneti, ongeza anwani zake hapa chini.',
    'Trusted proxies (one per line, e.g. 203.0.113.10 or 203.0.113.0/24; empty = this server and private networks)' => 'Proksi zinazoaminika (moja kwa kila mstari, mf. 203.0.113.10 au 203.0.113.0/24; wazi = seva hii na mitandao ya faragha)',
    'Forever' => 'Milele',
