    'What were you doing?' => 'Ulikuwa unafanya nini?',
    'Ask for a review' => 'Omba ukaguzi',
    '[%s] Someone asks you to review a firewall block' => '[%s] Mtu anakuomba ukague kizuizi cha ngome',
    'A visitor stopped by the firewall asks for a review. Open the Firewall screen to let them through or not:' => 'Mgeni aliyezuiwa na ngome anaomba ukaguzi. Fungua skrini ya Ngome ili umruhusu kupita au la:',
    'Request sent' => 'Ombi limetumwa',
    'Thank you. The owner of the site will look at it and, if it was a mistake, let you through.' => 'Asante. Mmiliki wa tovuti ataliangalia na, ikiwa lilikuwa kosa, atakuruhusu kupita.',
    'Review: %s' => 'Ukaguzi: %s',
    'This request was stopped for security reasons. If you think this is a mistake, tell the owner of the site what you were doing:' => 'Ombi hili limesimamishwa kwa sababu za usalama. Ukidhani ni kosa, mweleze mmiliki wa tovuti ulichokuwa ukifanya:',
    'The firewall is off: switch it on and save, then test again.' => 'Ngome imezimwa: iwashe, hifadhi, kisha jaribu tena.',
    'The test could not reach the site from the server itself (some hostings do not allow it). The firewall may still work: look at "Recent attacks".' => 'Jaribio halikuweza kufikia tovuti kutoka kwenye seva yenyewe (baadhi ya wenyeji hawaruhusu). Ngome bado inaweza kufanya kazi: angalia "Mashambulizi ya hivi karibuni".',
    'The test was stopped before it reached WordPress, by the hosting\'s own firewall. Good: two layers.' => 'Jaribio lilisimamishwa kabla ya kufika WordPress, na ngome ya mwenyeji mwenyewe. Vizuri: tabaka mbili.',
    'The test attack was not recognised. Please report it to Draco Insomnis.' => 'Shambulio la jaribio halikutambuliwa. Tafadhali iarifu Draco Insomnis.',
    'Works: a database injection was recognised and blocked (403).' => 'Inafanya kazi: uingizaji kwenye hifadhidata umetambuliwa na kuzuiwa (403).',
    'Works: a database injection was recognised. In "Log only" it is written down but not stopped; switch to "Block" when you are ready.' => 'Inafanya kazi: uingizaji kwenye hifadhidata umetambuliwa. Katika "Rekodi tu" unaandikwa lakini hauzuiwi; hamia "Zuia" ukiwa tayari.',
    'Test the firewall' => 'Jaribu ngome',
    'Sends a harmless attack-shaped request to the site and tells you what happened. It is not logged.' => 'Inatuma kwa tovuti ombi lisilo na madhara lenye umbo la shambulio na kukueleza kilichotokea. Halirekodiwi.',
