    'Last 7 days' => 'Siku 7 zilizopita',
    'Busiest addresses' => 'Anwani zenye shughuli nyingi zaidi',
    'Waiting: %d' => 'Yanasubiri: %d',
    'Review requests' => 'Maombi ya ukaguzi',
    'People the firewall stopped can ask from the block page. Let them through for a while if it was a mistake. Draco never writes to them: answer from your own mail if you want.' => 'Watu waliozuiwa na ngome wanaweza kuomba kutoka kwenye ukurasa wa kizuizi. Waruhusu kupita kwa muda ikiwa lilikuwa kosa. Draco haiwaandikii kamwe: jibu kutoka kwa barua pepe yako mwenyewe ukipenda.',
    'Let through' => 'Ruhusu kupita',
    'Denied' => 'Limekataliwa',
    'Attacker: blocked' => 'Mshambulizi: amezuiwa',
    '24 hours' => 'Saa 24',
    'Deny' => 'Kataa',
    'Attacker' => 'Mshambulizi',
    'No requests.' => 'Hakuna maombi.',
    'country not allowed' => 'nchi hairuhusiwi',
    'The country list could not be downloaded. The filter does nothing until it is there; try "Update the country list" later.' => 'Orodha ya nchi haikuweza kupakuliwa. Kichujio hakifanyi chochote hadi iwepo; jaribu "Sasisha orodha ya nchi" baadaye.',
    'Country list downloaded.' => 'Orodha ya nchi imepakuliwa.',
    'Countries' => 'Nchi',
    'Most of your visitors may come from many countries, and an attacker changes country with a VPN. Filter only logging in, signing up and forms, and start with "Log only". Administrators, people you let through and search engines are never filtered.' => 'Wageni wako wanaweza kutoka nchi nyingi, na mshambulizi hubadilisha nchi kwa VPN. Chuja tu kuingia, usajili na fomu, na uanze na "Rekodi tu". Wasimamizi, watu uliowaruhusu kupita na injini za utafutaji hawachujwi kamwe.',
    'Filter' => 'Kichujio',
    'Refuse the countries listed' => 'Kataa nchi zilizoorodheshwa',
