    'The password must have at least %d characters.' => 'Nenosiri lazima liwe na angalau herufi %d.',
    'This password appears in known data breaches, so attackers try it first. Please choose another one.' => 'Nenosiri hili linaonekana katika uvujaji wa data unaojulikana, kwa hivyo washambulizi hulijaribu kwanza. Tafadhali chagua jingine.',
    'Your password appears in known data breaches.' => 'Nenosiri lako linaonekana katika uvujaji wa data unaojulikana.',
    'Attackers try those first. Change it now:' => 'Washambulizi hujaribu hayo kwanza. Libadilishe sasa:',
    'Change my password' => 'Badilisha nenosiri langu',
    'Passwords' => 'Manenosiri',
    'Applied when someone chooses a password: profile, reset and WooCommerce sign-up. Existing passwords keep working.' => 'Inatumika mtu anapochagua nenosiri: wasifu, kuweka upya na usajili wa WooCommerce. Manenosiri yaliyopo yanaendelea kufanya kazi.',
    'Minimum length' => 'Urefu wa chini',
    'No minimum (WordPress default)' => 'Hakuna kiwango cha chini (chaguo-msingi la WordPress)',
    '%d characters' => 'herufi %d',
    'recommended' => 'inapendekezwa',
    'Refuse passwords that appear in known data breaches, and warn people who log in with one' => 'Kataa manenosiri yanayoonekana katika uvujaji unaojulikana, na uwaonye wanaoingia kwa nenosiri kama hilo',
    'Asks Have I Been Pwned with only the first 5 characters of the password\'s SHA-1: the password never leaves your site. If the service does not answer in 3 seconds, the password is accepted.' => 'Inauliza Have I Been Pwned kwa herufi 5 za kwanza tu za SHA-1 ya nenosiri: nenosiri haliondoki kamwe kwenye tovuti yako. Huduma isipojibu ndani ya sekunde 3, nenosiri linakubaliwa.',
    'Send security headers on public pages (no sniffing of file types, no framing by other sites, less referrer data, no camera, microphone or location for embedded content)' => 'Tuma vichwa vya usalama kwenye kurasa za umma (bila kukisia aina za faili, bila kuwekwa kwenye fremu na tovuti nyingine, data kidogo ya chanzo, bila kamera, maikrofoni au eneo kwa maudhui yaliyopachikwa)',
    'Safe for almost every site. If another plugin or the server already sends one of them, Draco leaves it alone.' => 'Salama kwa karibu kila tovuti. Programu-jalizi nyingine au seva ikishatuma kimoja wapo, Draco hakigusi.',
    'Force HTTPS in browsers for 6 months (HSTS)' => 'Lazimisha HTTPS kwenye vivinjari kwa miezi 6 (HSTS)',
    'Only when the whole site works on HTTPS and will keep working: browsers remember it and refuse plain HTTP until it expires.' => 'Tu ikiwa tovuti nzima inafanya kazi kwa HTTPS na itaendelea hivyo: vivinjari hukumbuka na kukataa HTTP hadi muda uishe.',
